---
// Footer.astro
---
<footer class="bg-background border-t border-neutral-900 text-foreground py-8 mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-8 flex flex-col justify-between items-center">
    <p class="text-muted font-montserrat max-w-lg text-center leading-relaxed">
      Built with 
      <span class="text-foreground font-semibold font-iceberg">TypeScript, HTML, Tailwind CSS</span>, and 
      <span class="text-foreground font-semibold font-iceberg">Astro</span>. 
      Designed and developed by 
      <span class="text-primary font-semibold font-iceberg text-nowrap">
        <a href="https://github.com/gitongaisaac" target="_blank" class="inline text-nowrap hover:underline">
          <span class="px-0.5">Isaac G.</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-xs"></i>
        </a>
      </span>. Deployed on 
      <span class="text-foreground font-semibold font-iceberg">Vercel</span>.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-2 w-full flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 items-center justify-center">
        <a href="https://isaacgitonga.com" class="hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">
          <img
            src="/logos/logo-dark.png"
            alt="Logo"
            class="size-9 rounded-full"
          />
        </a>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-md px-4 py-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="font-iceberg text-sm text-foreground">isaacggitonga@gmail.com</span>
          <button
            class="copy-email text-muted hover:text-foreground active:scale-70 transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer"
            title="Copy Email"
          >
            <i class="fa-solid fa-copy"></i>
          </button>
        </div>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/gitongaisaac/portfolio"
          target="_blank"
          class="text-muted hover:text-foreground transition-colors text-3xl"
        >
          <i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-neutral-700 font-montserrat text-center text-xs max-w-md mt-4">
        Source code available for inspection. Inspiration encouraged; attribution appreciated.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-sm text-muted-dark mt-4">
      &copy; <span class="year">{new Date().getFullYear()}</span> Isaac G. All rights reserved.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
